    owl:members ( mds:AttenuatorWheelsPosition mds:BeamStopRotation mds:BeamStopTransversePosition mds:BeamStopVerticalPosition mds:BottomCaveSlitPosition mds:DetectorXOrientation mds:DetectorXPosition mds:DetectorYOrientation mds:DetectorYPosition mds:DetectorZOrientation mds:DetectorZPosition mds:HorizontalCaveSlitPosition mds:HorizontalCaveSlitWidth mds:HuberStageHorizontalPosition mds:HuberStageRotation mds:HuberStageTransversePosition mds:MonochromatorAngleChi mds:MonochromatorAnglePhi mds:MonochromatorCrystalSeparation mds:MonochromatorOffset mds:MonochromatorPitch mds:MonochromatorRotation mds:MonochromatorTransversePosition mds:MonochromatorVerticalPosition mds:OpticalTableHorizontalOrientation mds:OpticalTableHorizontalPosition mds:OpticalTableJackDownstreamRightPosition mds:OpticalTableJackLeftPosition mds:OpticalTableJackUpstreamPosition mds:OpticalTableTransverseOrientation mds:OpticalTableTransversePosition mds:OpticalTableVerticalOrientation mds:PiezoelectricVoltage mds:SampleVerticalOrientation mds:SampleXPosition mds:SampleYPosition mds:SampleZPosition mds:SlitTransversePosition mds:SlitVerticalBladesBottomPosition mds:SlitVerticalBladesLeftPosition mds:SlitVerticalBladesRightPosition mds:SlitVerticalBladesTopPosition mds:SlitVerticalPosition mds:TopCaveSlitPosition mds:TungstenShieldHorizontalPosition mds:TungstenShieldVerticalPosition mds:UndulatorPosition mds:XrayShutterTransversePosition mds:XrayShutterVerticalPosition ) .

